From: Christian Gmeiner <cgmeiner@igalia.com>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 037] panvk: Advertise VK_EXT_image_compression_control

Purpose: advertise VK_EXT_image_compression_control (device-proven)
Source/Reference: upstream Mesa commit 6409a5b16af (author preserved)
Backport-of: 6409a5b16af
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (0xb8a31030, PAN_ARCH 11)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b3e50d8c7c7794f97a2df1742613b
Dependencies: csf-v11/036
Validation test: tests/dxvk/vulkan/backport-ext/icc.c (6 optimal + 16 modifier cases, ICC_FAILS=0)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 95596c3ed44fb41087d3b8cc465e063d3e2435df..a4d7019e3596fed1650153863c70260ed252d6fb 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -173,6 +173,7 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_extensions)(
       .EXT_host_image_copy = true,
       .EXT_host_query_reset = true,
       .EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d = true,
+      .EXT_image_compression_control = true,
       /* EXT_image_drm_format_modifier depends on KHR_sampler_ycbcr_conversion */
       .EXT_image_drm_format_modifier = true,
       .EXT_image_robustness = true,
@@ -595,6 +596,9 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_features)(
       .image2DViewOf3D = true,
       .sampler2DViewOf3D = true,
 
+      /* VK_EXT_image_compression_control */
+      .imageCompressionControl = true,
+
       /* VK_EXT_image_sliced_view_of_3d */
       .imageSlicedViewOf3D = true,
 
